rait_beetchi.png","caption":"Внутриигровой портрет"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/9c/9c52de009c4cafb04a05.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Portrait_beetchi_3.png","caption":"Вариант с зеленой полосой"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/f7/f7d72ec4828a533bf48e.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Portrait_beetchi_4.png","caption":"Красно-полосатый вариант"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/49/49e91fa03aaeac3a63de.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hatchitchi_Paradise_sprite_hide.png","caption":"Скрытие (Рай)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/c1/c17296740c4c721bd4d1.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hatchitchi_Paradise_sprite_death.png","caption":"Умирание (Рай)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/99/99512ad7548004e52b6a.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hatchitchi_paradise.png","caption":"Изображение Hatchitchi."},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/bf/bfa7374c8a99a05df272.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hatchitchi_Paradise_Field_sprite.png","caption":"Вид на поле в Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/47/477d90949db7cd2b697e.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hatchitchi_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Спрайт крупным планом · Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-paradise-cd150b","title":"Tamagotchi Paradise","ru":"Tamagotchi Paradise","kind":"device","note":""}]}